<p>Wolfe, Gene. <em>The Fifth Head of Cerberus</em>. New York: Ace Books, 1981 edition.</p>
<p>Wolfe, Gene. “The HORRARS of War.” <em>Endangered Species</em>. New York: Tom Doherty Associates, LLC, 1989. 237-257.</p>
<p>Wolfe, Gene. “The Largest Luger.” <em>Young Wolfe</em>. United Mythologies, 1992.</p>
<p>Wolfe, Gene. “Trip, Trap.” <em>Storeys from the Old Hotel</em>. New York: Tom Doherty Associates, LLC, 1988,238-263.</p>
